    "Invalid": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無効"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is disconnected and must be paired again with a new code. Other devices stay paired.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この端末は切断され、使うには新しいコードで再度ペアリングが必要です。ほかの端末はペアリングされたままです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is locked (git worktree lock).": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ロックされています（git worktree lock）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is no longer a worktree of its repository.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リポジトリのワークツリーではなくなっています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items only in the folder being synced to go to its Trash (on a server: its Trash there). Nothing is deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同期先のフォルダにしかない項目をそのゴミ箱（サーバではサーバ上のゴミ箱）に移動します。何も削除しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its active run is cancelled. Its history is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実行中の処理は中止されます。履歴は残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its folder %@ and everything in it stay as they are. Panes using it keep running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "フォルダ%@とその中身はそのまま残ります。このアカウントを使っているペーンも動き続けます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its history is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "履歴は残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jump to Latest Attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最新の通知へ移動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "残す"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Awake": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スリープしない"
          }
